545
01:03:19.500 --> 01:03:21.790
It's festival night.
Get yourself down there.

546
01:03:24.042 --> 01:03:26.292
Yeah, of course, yeah.
We'll be there in two secs.

547
01:03:26.458 --> 01:03:29.998
Okay. See you down there.

548
01:03:30.083 --> 01:03:32.173
See you.

549
01:04:00.417 --> 01:04:02.537
