583
01:07:57.667 --> 01:07:59.327
Uh, Gunn's Wood.

584
01:08:03.833 --> 01:08:05.673
Know how to work that, right? Yeah?

585
01:08:05.792 --> 01:08:07.882
Yeah, cheers. Thank you.

586
