Sammy! Sammy!

592
01:09:04.750 --> 01:09:06.670
Sammy!

593
01:09:07.750 --> 01:09:09.460
Sammy!

594
01:09:09.917 --> 01:09:11.827
Sammy!

595
01:09:13.500 --> 01:09:15.130
Calum!

596
