598
01:09:21.583 --> 01:09:23.253
Sammy!

599
01:09:25.875 --> 01:09:27.375
Sammy!

600
01:09:33.125 --> 01:09:34.785
Sammy!

601
01:09:36.000 --> 01:09:37.830
Sammy!

602
01:09:37.917 --> 01:09:39.577
Sammy!

603
01:09:41.792 --> 01:09:43.502
Sammy!

604
