611
01:10:06.292 --> 01:10:08.002
Sammy!

612
01:10:10.625 --> 01:10:12.285
Sammy!

613
01:10:15.792 --> 01:10:17.462
Sammy!

614
01:10:20.000 --> 01:10:21.790
Calum!

615
01:10:22.542 --> 01:10:24.132
Sammy!

616
01:10:26.250 --> 01:10:28.080
Sammy!

617
