671
01:17:55.375 --> 01:17:57.745
I lined up the shot.
I lined up the shot.

672
01:20:07.417 --> 01:20:12.167
Any idea how sick this is,
what you've done?

673
01:20:13.833 --> 01:20:15.543
Sorry.

674
01:20:17.167 --> 01:20:19.247
That's not gonna be enough.

675
